WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.424
On the estate side: every
governed scope is listed,

3
00:00:04.424 --> 00:00:09.292
and you've written down what isn't; each
role's settings match the tier everywhere,

4
00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:14.233
and a fresh read after the apply shows
nothing left; no standing privileged roles

5
00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:19.175
remain outside owned exceptions; and no
subscription has more than three owners.

6
00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:24.267
On the run side: the right roles, held
briefly, the right cloud, a reviewer who read

7
00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:29.437
the plan before the apply, and pinned
examples still matching what was reviewed.

8
00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:33.438
Next, Chapter 7 reviews who
holds these privileged roles.

9
00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:34.610
Thanks for watching.
